    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d684">

                <pb facs="0734" n="476" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg476"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1992a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gerard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-18T19:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 18, 1915, 7 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1965. Following message has been sent by wireless by Bernstorff to his Government:</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>In confidential and friendly conversation with Secretary of State whole
                        ground was covered. It seems that our note is considered least satisfactory
                        with regard to <hi rendition="#italic">Lusitania</hi>. Effective pressure by
                        American Government on England not to be expected if American public opinion
                        is not satisfied on this point.</p>
                    <pb facs="0735" n="477" xml:id="pg477"/>
                    <p>As possible formula, it was suggested for us to say that attack on <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Lusitania</hi> was justified as reprisal but that we
                        were responsible if neutral citizens suffered by our reprisal.</p>
                </quote>
                <p>Last sentence conclusion by Bernstorff
                    from long conversation by me. Bear this in mind if matter is discussed by you.
                    Extent of responsibility based on illegality of acts of retaliation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
